--[[
        ENTITY TRAIN -- six Interminable Rooms entities, one behind the other, rush through the rooms

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/EntityTrain"))()

        A-60's scream, the lights of your room flickering: hide. A-60, A-15, A-35, A-100, A-200 and E-22 (their faces
        from the Interminable Rooms wiki, A-200's moving, each in its colour and its light, their own sounds) come one
        right behind the other, like the carriages of a train, from the oldest room loaded to the newest, the screen
        shaking as they pass and the lights of each room flickering. Not hidden where one of them sees you: that one's
        face, its scream, your death.

        Only you see it. Run it again: a new one (the one before goes). Outside DOORS it runs along a line through you.
]]

